## Description

We just added 41M+ life science papers to the Firecrawl Research Index.  Your AI agents can now search drug discovery, clinical trial, and biology literature with 90% recall@10.  All sourced from authoritative sources and 100% free. Live in the API via /search/research. https://t.co/UeeNNnngpo

